1
00:00:05,734 --> 00:00:07,321
(All characters, places, and organizations
in this drama are fictitious.)

2
00:00:07,346 --> 00:00:08,984
(Filming followed broadcast guidelines
for minors, some scenes used AI.)

3
00:00:10,284 --> 00:00:12,563
(Episode 30)

4
00:00:28,097 --> 00:00:32,000
- Gyu Rim!
- Hey, Gyu Seo.

5
00:00:32,281 --> 00:00:34,387
What are you doing up at this hour?

6
00:00:37,469 --> 00:00:41,653
- You're still not asleep?
- I just can't sleep.

7
00:00:42,354 --> 00:00:44,121
Did you come out to get some water?

8
00:00:45,997 --> 00:00:47,731
Get some sleep, Gyu Rim.

9
00:00:48,201 --> 00:00:51,431
Gyu Min said you didn't get
a wink of sleep last night either.

10
00:00:52,541 --> 00:00:54,869
What if you end up collapsing?

11
00:00:55,193 --> 00:00:56,674
I'm Han Gyu Rim.

12
00:00:56,795 --> 00:00:59,642
You think I'm some weakling who'd collapse
from losing a little sleep?

13
00:01:00,927 --> 00:01:02,623
What are you made of, iron?

14
00:01:02,767 --> 00:01:06,014
Didn't you know?
I even fire rocket punches sometimes.

15
00:01:09,062 --> 00:01:10,420
I'll do better.

16
00:01:10,973 --> 00:01:15,527
I'll be really good,
so just forgive Gyu O, okay?

17
00:01:17,267 --> 00:01:18,839
No. I won't forgive him.

18
00:01:19,341 --> 00:01:23,138
I'll eat three bowls of rice at breakfast
and beat Gyu O half to death.

19
00:01:25,653 --> 00:01:29,462
If you're going to hit someone, hit me.
Just hit me instead.

20
00:01:30,214 --> 00:01:32,683
If you're mad at Gyu O,
just take it all out on me, Gyu Rim.

21
00:01:32,788 --> 00:01:34,926
You think you and Gyu Min
are off the hook?

22
00:01:35,667 --> 00:01:38,189
You two will pay for keeping it from me
and leaving me in the dark.

23
00:01:38,249 --> 00:01:42,683
So go get a switch and prepare yourselves.

24
00:02:18,101 --> 00:02:20,341
Gyu O, are you okay?

25
00:02:23,061 --> 00:02:28,435
Why are you burning up? Gyu O!

26
00:02:29,668 --> 00:02:31,108
Hold on.

27
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:38,415
Gyu Rim! What do we do about Gyu O?

28
00:02:44,127 --> 00:02:45,830
It's 39.2 degrees.

29
00:02:46,102 --> 00:02:47,836
Shouldn't we go to the emergency room?

30
00:02:49,907 --> 00:02:52,178
Gyu O! Han Gyu O!

31
00:02:52,418 --> 00:02:53,778
Gyu O!

32
00:02:55,532 --> 00:02:59,179
Let's go to the hospital. Can you get up?

33
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:04,018
I'm fine.

34
00:03:04,379 --> 00:03:08,494
How are you fine?
You're burning up right now.

35
00:03:08,574 --> 00:03:10,622
Your fever's over 39 degrees.

36
00:03:10,856 --> 00:03:14,102
I'm not going to the hospital. I'm fine.

37
00:03:15,934 --> 00:03:18,031
I'll get some medicine for the fever
and some ice water.

38
00:03:18,056 --> 00:03:19,178
Okay.

39
00:03:22,587 --> 00:03:25,082
Why is the mighty Han Gyu O sick?

40
00:03:25,587 --> 00:03:27,389
Why are you sick, Gyu O?

41
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:01,550
I'll take care of him,
so get some sleep, Gyu Seo.

42
00:04:02,961 --> 00:04:06,264
I'll stay with him,
so you go get some shut-eye.

43
00:04:10,174 --> 00:04:13,542
It's already 5 a.m. It'll be morning soon.

44
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:20,488
- Can you go get a basin of cold water?
- Okay.

45
00:04:38,447 --> 00:04:40,063
I won't give up on you.

46
00:04:41,014 --> 00:04:43,215
No matter what you do,

47
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,768
I won't give up on you.

48
00:04:55,954 --> 00:04:58,340
Even if everyone
in the world abandons you,

49
00:05:00,187 --> 00:05:02,294
I'll never abandon you.

50
00:05:03,967 --> 00:05:10,202
I'll stick to you like superglue
and never let go,

51
00:05:11,541 --> 00:05:14,235
so get that straight, Han Gyu O.

52
00:05:43,343 --> 00:05:44,767
You're up already?

53
00:05:53,498 --> 00:05:54,821
What's this, first thing in the morning?

54
00:05:57,457 --> 00:05:58,634
Booze?

55
00:06:06,527 --> 00:06:07,894
I had a dream.

56
00:06:09,533 --> 00:06:14,232
Gyu Rim was pinned beneath
a massive boulder,

57
00:06:14,573 --> 00:06:17,006
gasping and struggling for air,

58
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:21,856
and I couldn't do anything to help her.

59
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:26,515
I couldn't even move a finger...

60
00:06:27,413 --> 00:06:30,615
All I could do was watch.

61
00:06:31,488 --> 00:06:33,967
It was only a dream. If it had been real,

62
00:06:34,327 --> 00:06:37,620
you would've head-butted that boulder
to save Gyu Rim, wouldn't you?

63
00:06:42,647 --> 00:06:46,682
Instead of talking about Gyu Rim,
why don't you talk about yourself?

64
00:06:49,500 --> 00:06:52,964
You had a hunch who it was, didn't you?

65
00:06:53,154 --> 00:06:59,224
The unlikely person who got Yong Cheol
and Mr. Im to sabotage our restaurant.

66
00:07:00,561 --> 00:07:03,861
That's why you told me not to tell you
if I ever found out who did it.

67
00:07:04,254 --> 00:07:07,939
That's why you told me to let it go,
right?

68
00:07:22,427 --> 00:07:24,238
The person behind it all.

69
00:07:26,733 --> 00:07:31,205
- So what did she say her goal was?
- What?

70
00:07:32,545 --> 00:07:37,404
Trampling all over eight years
of her son's life...

71
00:07:40,167 --> 00:07:43,187
What was the point of doing something
that ridiculous?

72
00:07:46,734 --> 00:07:48,767
To separate Gyu Rim from me?

73
00:07:49,567 --> 00:07:52,172
Or for me to break up with Gyu Rim?

74
00:07:55,147 --> 00:07:58,660
Hey, what is all this? What am I?

75
00:07:59,401 --> 00:08:02,523
What am I, some amazing, perfect son?

76
00:08:03,014 --> 00:08:07,293
Why is she so high and mighty over a guy
who's not even worth an eighth of Gyu Rim?

77
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:10,586
Jeong Woo, I'm ashamed. I'm humiliated.

78
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,800
I'm so ashamed.

79
00:08:12,825 --> 00:08:15,994
I want to dig a hole in the ground,
crawl in, and hide.

80
00:08:17,266 --> 00:08:22,167
Jeong Woo, she told me to give it all up,
so I gave it all up.

81
00:08:22,467 --> 00:08:24,929
She told me to drop everything and leave,
so I dropped everything and left.

82
00:08:26,721 --> 00:08:29,841
Am I a doll for my mother to play with?
Me, Kim Mu Jin?

83
00:08:31,041 --> 00:08:32,574
Do I belong to her?

84
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:53,548
Why is Gyu O sick, Mom?

85
00:08:53,987 --> 00:08:58,560
Well... Maybe he had it coming?

86
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:01,065
Why did he have it coming?

87
00:09:03,757 --> 00:09:04,934
Well...

88
00:09:05,561 --> 00:09:09,870
It's the first time in my life
I've seen Gyu O this sick.

89
00:09:10,914 --> 00:09:14,724
Me too. I've never seen
him like this either.

90
00:09:14,847 --> 00:09:19,116
What's that smell?
Are you making sesame porridge?

91
00:09:19,968 --> 00:09:22,304
It's sesame porridge, my favorite!

92
00:09:23,534 --> 00:09:25,685
That's not for you, Grandpa.

93
00:09:25,793 --> 00:09:27,955
She's making it because Gyu O is sick.

94
00:09:28,081 --> 00:09:31,272
What? Gyu O is sick?

95
00:09:31,535 --> 00:09:34,981
- Why is he sick?
- He probably had it coming.

96
00:09:36,267 --> 00:09:39,642
He never gets sick.

97
00:09:39,667 --> 00:09:45,676
Even when we all got COVID,
Gyu O was the only one who was fine.

98
00:09:46,314 --> 00:09:48,708
Everyone gets sick.

99
00:09:49,381 --> 00:09:51,201
Some people just pretend they don't.

100
00:09:54,921 --> 00:09:59,042
Grandpa, you're not sick,
but you always pretend you are. Right?

101
00:09:59,707 --> 00:10:02,923
When? What year, what month,
what hour, what minute, what second?

102
00:10:03,154 --> 00:10:08,052
On August 27, 2026, but I don't know
the hour, the minute, or the second.

103
00:10:09,647 --> 00:10:12,790
Gyu O took his medicine and is sleeping,
so let's keep our voices down.

104
00:10:12,974 --> 00:10:13,980
Okay.

105
00:10:19,139 --> 00:10:20,494
Well...

106
00:10:20,841 --> 00:10:25,310
He's not made of steel.
Of course he'd get sick.

107
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:28,864
He is not human if he never gets sick.

108
00:10:41,147 --> 00:10:45,528
Would it have been better
if your mom had raised you?

109
00:10:49,667 --> 00:10:54,509
If your mom had raised you guys instead,

110
00:10:55,216 --> 00:10:59,070
would you or Gyu O be better off now?

111
00:11:07,607 --> 00:11:09,328
Please tell me no.

112
00:11:11,914 --> 00:11:14,296
I guess it's not a no, Grandpa.

113
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,306
He's back to normal now, right?

114
00:11:31,027 --> 00:11:34,892
No, he's still at 37.2.
His fever needs to come down more.

115
00:11:38,128 --> 00:11:39,883
What's going on with him?

116
00:11:40,614 --> 00:11:43,167
It's the first time I've ever seen Gyu O
this sick. Seriously.

117
00:11:47,233 --> 00:11:50,724
Gyu O didn't get dumped, did he?

118
00:11:55,481 --> 00:11:58,622
I'll head to school first,
so take your time and come later.

119
00:11:59,081 --> 00:12:00,400
Why? Let's go together.

120
00:12:01,559 --> 00:12:03,239
We still have 30 more minutes.

121
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,160
I'm meeting a friend early at school.

122
00:12:06,541 --> 00:12:07,777
See you at school later.

123
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,380
You remember me, right?

124
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,839
Can I talk to you for a moment?

125
00:13:02,567 --> 00:13:04,281
It'll really just take a moment.

126
00:13:08,987 --> 00:13:10,522
I have nothing to say to you.

127
00:13:13,007 --> 00:13:16,721
You ignored all my calls and texts,
so I figured something was up.

128
00:13:17,875 --> 00:13:19,388
Just ten minutes.

129
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:26,974
Start the stopwatch. Not a minute,
not a second over. Ten minutes. Please.

130
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:33,561
You have two minutes left.

131
00:13:43,734 --> 00:13:47,375
- Did you break up with Gyu O?
- Yes.

132
00:13:49,974 --> 00:13:51,482
How can love just change like that?

133
00:13:53,267 --> 00:13:54,963
You said you'd never give up.

134
00:13:55,614 --> 00:13:57,487
You said you'd never abandon him.

135
00:13:57,674 --> 00:14:01,773
You said if he flew away from you,
you'd break his legs to keep him close.

136
00:14:02,147 --> 00:14:05,183
You said you wanted to marry Gyu O
and become part of our family.

137
00:14:05,554 --> 00:14:08,286
I don't know what came over me back then.
I wasn't thinking straight.

138
00:14:09,321 --> 00:14:12,409
But now I've come to my senses
and I'm thinking clearly again...

139
00:14:12,434 --> 00:14:14,369
What about Gyu O, then?

140
00:14:15,107 --> 00:14:17,896
You got him all worked up,
and now you're just walking away?

141
00:14:18,367 --> 00:14:20,369
So you just take what you want
and throw him away?

142
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:25,059
Love means being there for someone
and holding them close in hard times.

143
00:14:25,613 --> 00:14:27,949
How can love be like that?

144
00:14:30,281 --> 00:14:32,439
I thought it was love, but it wasn't.

145
00:14:32,827 --> 00:14:34,539
I didn't love him.

146
00:14:35,261 --> 00:14:37,782
I told you earlier,
I was under some kind of spell.

147
00:14:41,700 --> 00:14:46,088
If you're a student, focus on school.
Stay out of grown-up business.

148
00:14:46,340 --> 00:14:48,535
Right now, Gyu O is sick...

149
00:14:54,401 --> 00:14:56,174
The ten minutes are up, right?

150
00:14:59,701 --> 00:15:01,446
Don't ever come looking for me again.

151
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:04,183
If you see me on the street,
don't act like you know me.

152
00:15:42,322 --> 00:15:44,976
(Mom)

153
00:15:56,281 --> 00:15:58,626
Mom, did you eat?

154
00:15:58,794 --> 00:16:01,674
That guy from before?

155
00:16:02,247 --> 00:16:06,005
When I looked closer, he wasn't great,
so I ended it.

156
00:16:07,700 --> 00:16:09,658
He doesn't have much.

157
00:16:12,690 --> 00:16:14,080
He's poor.

158
00:16:17,266 --> 00:16:21,837
He's nice, but you can't live on kindness.

159
00:16:23,461 --> 00:16:27,854
So, Mom, I'm going to marry a rich guy.

160
00:16:30,906 --> 00:16:33,778
One of Hui Seop's friends, Yeong Seok...

161
00:16:34,694 --> 00:16:37,027
He still gets in touch with me,

162
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,899
so maybe I should just marry him?

163
00:16:43,093 --> 00:16:47,420
His family owns lots
of land and buildings,

164
00:16:48,394 --> 00:16:50,581
and they're one of the richest
families in Andong.

165
00:17:00,518 --> 00:17:01,800
Are you okay?

166
00:17:04,790 --> 00:17:05,980
I'm fine.

167
00:17:08,354 --> 00:17:10,645
Do you want to get up
and eat some porridge?

168
00:17:14,367 --> 00:17:16,492
I'll sleep a little more and then get up.

169
00:17:19,647 --> 00:17:22,174
Okay. Get some more sleep.

170
00:17:25,620 --> 00:17:27,824
Once I get a little more sleep,

171
00:17:30,639 --> 00:17:32,114
I won't fall apart again.

172
00:17:35,507 --> 00:17:37,652
I really won't.

173
00:17:40,199 --> 00:17:41,348
Okay.

174
00:17:43,647 --> 00:17:47,243
Even if the whole world
tries to bring me down,

175
00:17:50,016 --> 00:17:51,447
I won't stay down.

176
00:17:54,839 --> 00:17:55,954
Okay.

177
00:17:58,474 --> 00:18:02,307
Go on, Gyu Rim.
I'm really going to sleep now.

178
00:18:07,854 --> 00:18:08,921
Gyu Rim.

179
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,621
I'm worried about Hui Na.

180
00:18:19,147 --> 00:18:25,173
When I'm sick, I have you to care for me,
as well as Gyu Seo and Gyu Min.

181
00:18:28,548 --> 00:18:31,958
I have so much family to lean on.

182
00:18:37,574 --> 00:18:38,973
She has no one.

183
00:18:42,085 --> 00:18:43,954
She has to get through it all alone.

184
00:18:47,033 --> 00:18:48,161
You're right.

185
00:18:50,447 --> 00:18:54,360
Poor Ms. Kwon. What will she do?

186
00:19:28,833 --> 00:19:31,343
Everything I said about respecting you,

187
00:19:31,657 --> 00:19:35,304
and calling you my role model,
I take it all back as of today.

188
00:19:38,164 --> 00:19:39,318
Jeong Woo.

189
00:19:46,921 --> 00:19:51,059
What on earth did you do
to get one woman out of your son's life?

190
00:19:52,034 --> 00:19:53,802
How far are you planning to go?

191
00:19:54,288 --> 00:19:55,860
This isn't like you, ma'am.

192
00:19:56,494 --> 00:19:59,113
Did you really not consider
how this would affect us at all?

193
00:20:01,827 --> 00:20:05,171
What are you talking about?

194
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:07,851
I just grilled Seo Yong Cheol,

195
00:20:11,767 --> 00:20:16,484
and he told me
you're the one behind all this.

196
00:20:20,093 --> 00:20:23,422
If it's not true, tell me it's not.

197
00:20:24,106 --> 00:20:27,243
If you tell me you didn't do it,
I'll believe you.

198
00:20:27,481 --> 00:20:31,570
I'll have Seo Yong Cheol arrested
for defamation and false charges,

199
00:20:31,761 --> 00:20:36,065
so if it's not true, tell me it's not.

200
00:20:36,514 --> 00:20:38,818
I'll believe whatever you say,

201
00:20:39,032 --> 00:20:44,442
so just say, "It's not true!"
Just once, tell me you didn't do it.

202
00:20:53,427 --> 00:20:54,713
Please,

203
00:20:56,881 --> 00:20:58,321
tell me it's not true.

204
00:20:59,906 --> 00:21:05,730
If Yong Cheol was right about you,
I could accept that.

205
00:21:06,251 --> 00:21:07,438
But Mu Jin...

206
00:21:10,260 --> 00:21:12,341
What about poor Mu Jin?

207
00:21:12,534 --> 00:21:16,648
How is my friend supposed to go on?

208
00:21:17,760 --> 00:21:22,340
How is your son supposed to live
with this weighing on him?

209
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,380
Tell me it's not true, ma'am.

210
00:21:43,111 --> 00:21:46,232
(Mu Jin)

211
00:22:06,035 --> 00:22:08,236
(Mother)

212
00:22:18,685 --> 00:22:19,941
When are you coming?

213
00:22:24,467 --> 00:22:26,740
When are you coming
to grab me by the collar?

214
00:22:28,681 --> 00:22:32,735
I'll take you on anytime, so bring it on.

215
00:22:35,667 --> 00:22:39,161
Hello? Who am I talking to?

216
00:22:40,487 --> 00:22:43,831
Can't you talk? Cat got your tongue?

217
00:22:47,367 --> 00:22:49,752
Hello? Mu Jin! Kim Mu Jin!

218
00:22:58,140 --> 00:23:00,103
That brat hung up on me?

219
00:23:00,908 --> 00:23:04,834
Is he really never going to see me again?

220
00:23:07,697 --> 00:23:12,072
Fine. I'll just pretend
I don't have a son.

221
00:23:14,239 --> 00:23:15,577
That brat...

222
00:23:17,887 --> 00:23:20,107
I'll pretend I never gave birth to him.

223
00:23:31,835 --> 00:23:38,835
(Suragan Side Dishes)

224
00:23:58,774 --> 00:24:03,039
Did something I ate at lunch
upset my stomach? What's wrong with me?

225
00:24:04,897 --> 00:24:07,971
(Jameon Medical Supplies)

226
00:24:13,081 --> 00:24:14,626
It's you, right? Isn't it?

227
00:24:14,859 --> 00:24:18,478
The one who sneaks over here to pee,

228
00:24:18,599 --> 00:24:22,259
that's you, isn't it?

229
00:24:22,500 --> 00:24:25,570
That makes it even more suspicious.

230
00:24:25,595 --> 00:24:29,662
If it's not you, then show me your face.

231
00:24:29,687 --> 00:24:31,103
Show me, I said.

232
00:24:31,128 --> 00:24:34,213
I caught the culprit.

233
00:24:34,600 --> 00:24:37,950
The one who keeps peeing on the wall,

234
00:24:37,975 --> 00:24:41,764
I caught that damn bastard in the act.

235
00:24:44,551 --> 00:24:49,058
No. When we watched the security footage,
the culprit was huge.

236
00:24:49,083 --> 00:24:54,231
You said you'd need a net
to catch someone that big,

237
00:24:54,256 --> 00:24:56,104
like a gorilla.

238
00:24:57,254 --> 00:25:02,174
Really? Then who's this?

239
00:25:02,387 --> 00:25:06,320
I don't know. Just some random passerby?

240
00:25:06,380 --> 00:25:10,362
Then why'd you turn away
so suspiciously when you saw me?

241
00:25:11,207 --> 00:25:15,145
Hey, did you borrow money
from me or something?

242
00:25:15,874 --> 00:25:17,964
Why are you squirming?

243
00:25:18,060 --> 00:25:22,180
When an adult is talking to you,
look them in the eye!

244
00:25:22,247 --> 00:25:25,048
Look at me.

245
00:25:25,081 --> 00:25:26,378
Look at me, I said!

246
00:25:26,403 --> 00:25:28,436
Ma'am, the bathroom.

247
00:25:28,567 --> 00:25:29,721
Don't you need to go to the bathroom?

248
00:25:29,746 --> 00:25:32,195
How did you know? I really need to...

249
00:25:32,228 --> 00:25:33,585
Keep an eye on her.

250
00:25:48,399 --> 00:25:49,679
Welcome...

251
00:25:55,762 --> 00:25:59,447
- I'm Han Gyu Yeong.
- Yes. What can I do for you?

252
00:26:00,851 --> 00:26:05,745
Have you seen any weird guys
hanging around the side dish shop?

253
00:26:05,897 --> 00:26:07,365
He's about this tall,

254
00:26:07,390 --> 00:26:09,540
and looks like a psycho
with a nasty temper.

255
00:26:09,789 --> 00:26:11,106
Well,

256
00:26:11,307 --> 00:26:15,432
I don't really keep track
of who goes into the side dish shop.

257
00:26:17,849 --> 00:26:20,013
Then please start keeping an eye out.

258
00:26:20,171 --> 00:26:22,483
Someone's life might be at stake.

259
00:26:22,601 --> 00:26:26,553
What? Whose? Gyu Rim's?

260
00:26:26,578 --> 00:26:27,578
Yes.

261
00:26:30,092 --> 00:26:31,372
Please give me your number.

262
00:26:32,604 --> 00:26:35,075
I'll send you a photo,

263
00:26:35,100 --> 00:26:37,579
and if a guy who looks like that shows up,
let me know right away...

264
00:26:39,059 --> 00:26:41,129
Actually, my phone
is off most of the time,

265
00:26:41,533 --> 00:26:45,375
so text Cho Heung Sik "PS..."

266
00:26:45,461 --> 00:26:47,249
Just type "PS" and send it to him.

267
00:26:48,009 --> 00:26:50,278
Wait, "PS?"

268
00:26:51,717 --> 00:26:53,086
Psycho Sighting.

269
00:26:57,156 --> 00:27:01,268
Don't tell Su Nam or Han Gyu Rim
that you saw me.

270
00:27:02,259 --> 00:27:03,563
"PS."

271
00:27:41,338 --> 00:27:42,492
Hello.

272
00:27:45,508 --> 00:27:46,891
Mu Jin.

273
00:27:48,541 --> 00:27:52,676
- Were you peeling potatoes?
- Yeah.

274
00:27:54,246 --> 00:27:56,453
How's Gyu O?

275
00:28:01,421 --> 00:28:03,049
He's pulling through.

276
00:28:05,529 --> 00:28:06,783
And you?

277
00:28:09,812 --> 00:28:10,974
Me too.

278
00:28:17,007 --> 00:28:19,886
But aren't you busy?

279
00:28:21,657 --> 00:28:22,973
No.

280
00:28:23,688 --> 00:28:27,231
We only do dinner now.
And today's our regular day off.

281
00:28:30,648 --> 00:28:32,425
- Gyu Rim.
- Yeah?

282
00:28:37,435 --> 00:28:39,073
What are parents and children
to each other?

283
00:28:41,796 --> 00:28:45,214
I just got curious all of a sudden.

284
00:28:56,554 --> 00:29:02,023
If you and Gyeol both fell
into the water...

285
00:29:02,048 --> 00:29:03,151
Okay.

286
00:29:04,396 --> 00:29:07,636
Then I'd save Gyeol first, no matter what.

287
00:29:13,540 --> 00:29:16,440
That's fine. I'm a good swimmer.

288
00:29:17,089 --> 00:29:18,352
A really good one.

289
00:29:19,715 --> 00:29:22,807
Did I never tell you
that my childhood nickname was "Seal?"

290
00:29:28,028 --> 00:29:32,053
Say there's one amazing dish,
the only one of its kind in the world.

291
00:29:32,078 --> 00:29:35,123
- Okay.
- But you and Gyeol...

292
00:29:35,183 --> 00:29:37,341
- both really want to eat it.
- Okay.

293
00:29:37,728 --> 00:29:41,086
Then I'd give it to Gyeol
without a second thought.

294
00:29:45,341 --> 00:29:47,029
Hey, I'm a chef.

295
00:29:47,246 --> 00:29:49,759
You think there's any food in the world
I haven't tried?

296
00:29:49,875 --> 00:29:51,399
Just give it all to Gyeol.

297
00:29:51,509 --> 00:29:56,002
I'll just get the recipe,
make it the same way, and eat it myself.

298
00:29:56,742 --> 00:30:00,363
Let's say I'm carrying you and Gyeol
on my back.

299
00:30:00,676 --> 00:30:03,657
But then a huge swamp
appears in front of me.

300
00:30:03,829 --> 00:30:06,589
- Okay.
- They say a scary crocodile lives there.

301
00:30:06,614 --> 00:30:07,721
Okay.

302
00:30:07,866 --> 00:30:11,618
I'm too tired to carry
you both any farther.

303
00:30:12,189 --> 00:30:15,634
I'd have to put one of you down
to save the other.

304
00:30:15,899 --> 00:30:16,998
Put Gyeol down and...

305
00:30:20,028 --> 00:30:23,903
No, you'd have to put me down.
I'm much heavier.

306
00:30:24,535 --> 00:30:29,048
Right. I'd gladly put you down
and save Gyeol.

307
00:30:33,914 --> 00:30:36,543
Well, of course you should.

308
00:30:37,595 --> 00:30:39,309
I've lived long enough,

309
00:30:39,608 --> 00:30:43,865
and Gyeol has his whole life ahead of him
and is still so fragile.

310
00:30:45,289 --> 00:30:47,344
That's what being a parent is about.

311
00:30:50,168 --> 00:30:53,327
You might sulk and feel really hurt,

312
00:30:53,765 --> 00:30:55,635
but that's how it is between
a mom and her son.

313
00:31:05,353 --> 00:31:07,829
Not every mother and son is like that.

314
00:31:10,957 --> 00:31:14,144
They just show it differently.
I bet deep down it's all the same.

315
00:31:15,835 --> 00:31:17,393
Even your mother.

316
00:31:35,510 --> 00:31:36,794
Give me one more glass.

317
00:31:37,919 --> 00:31:39,043
No.

318
00:31:39,638 --> 00:31:41,822
Is this a bar? That's your third glass.

319
00:31:42,741 --> 00:31:44,315
One more glass.

320
00:31:44,371 --> 00:31:47,201
I'll buy you a whole case later,
so give me one more.

321
00:31:47,226 --> 00:31:48,916
No. I won't.

322
00:31:50,196 --> 00:31:52,783
Hey, you're so petty.

323
00:31:52,868 --> 00:31:54,978
You think I can't drink without you?

324
00:31:55,662 --> 00:31:57,061
Are you nuts?

325
00:31:57,968 --> 00:31:59,725
You're driving me crazy, seriously.

326
00:32:00,362 --> 00:32:02,445
One minute you're saying
we should never see each other again,

327
00:32:02,470 --> 00:32:04,013
and the next, you're barging
into my office.

328
00:32:04,343 --> 00:32:07,427
I can't figure you out.
None of this makes any sense.

329
00:32:07,602 --> 00:32:08,806
You know, when I look at you,

330
00:32:09,282 --> 00:32:12,573
I think Mu Jin gets his stubborn streak
from you.

331
00:32:13,135 --> 00:32:14,395
Are you badmouthing my son?

332
00:32:14,521 --> 00:32:17,331
Why? Does it bother you
when I talk trash about your son?

333
00:32:18,341 --> 00:32:21,208
- Sit down.
- Why? You won't even give me a drink.

334
00:32:21,233 --> 00:32:23,951
Sit. Instead of a drink,
I'll compliment you.

335
00:32:25,661 --> 00:32:26,734
Hurry.

336
00:32:26,759 --> 00:32:30,209
Hey, Yun Jin told me what happened.

337
00:32:30,963 --> 00:32:34,321
Good job. You hit the brakes,
even if it was late.

338
00:32:34,882 --> 00:32:38,154
I thought you were going
to become a monster.

339
00:32:38,275 --> 00:32:39,933
It's a silver lining.

340
00:32:40,113 --> 00:32:42,366
Hong Ok Seon. Good job.

341
00:32:47,749 --> 00:32:50,269
Hey, be honest with me.

342
00:32:51,248 --> 00:32:53,723
Do you admit you were acting
a little strange?

343
00:32:54,515 --> 00:32:56,435
That you'd gone a little nuts?

344
00:32:56,562 --> 00:32:58,161
Do you admit you weren't
in your right mind?

345
00:32:58,239 --> 00:33:00,398
- Hey.
- Come on, admit it.

346
00:33:00,496 --> 00:33:04,053
Now get out there and go see Mu Jin.

347
00:33:04,443 --> 00:33:08,953
Go to Mu Jin and beg.
Ask him to forgive you.

348
00:33:09,303 --> 00:33:11,993
You need to apologize sincerely. Got it?

349
00:33:12,695 --> 00:33:14,881
And accept Gyu Rim, too.

350
00:33:15,541 --> 00:33:18,421
Stop hurting those kids.

351
00:33:18,446 --> 00:33:20,547
What's so special about being a parent?

352
00:33:20,708 --> 00:33:22,868
What, did you save the world
to earn the right to be a parent?

353
00:33:23,356 --> 00:33:24,800
Why did I even come here?

354
00:33:25,442 --> 00:33:28,439
Why did I come to you for a lecture?

355
00:33:28,464 --> 00:33:31,285
Hey, if you keep giving me attitude,
I won't hang out with you anymore.

356
00:33:31,310 --> 00:33:32,391
I won't see you anymore.

357
00:33:33,689 --> 00:33:34,961
- Hey.
- What?

358
00:33:35,088 --> 00:33:37,941
Hey, don't see me. Don't hang out with me.

359
00:33:37,966 --> 00:33:40,021
I've got other people
who'll hang out with me.

360
00:33:40,082 --> 00:33:41,401
- You do?
- Yes.

361
00:33:41,608 --> 00:33:43,034
- Really?
- I do.

362
00:33:44,566 --> 00:33:47,561
Hey, look. I'm getting a call. See? I do.

363
00:33:49,578 --> 00:33:51,258
(Mu Jin)

364
00:33:51,968 --> 00:33:53,032
Answer it.

365
00:33:53,510 --> 00:33:56,323
Why aren't you answering?
Playing hard to get? Who is it?

366
00:34:05,519 --> 00:34:06,606
Hello?

367
00:34:11,675 --> 00:34:13,348
Did you call the wrong number?

368
00:34:16,101 --> 00:34:18,074
After hanging up without saying a word?

369
00:34:21,322 --> 00:34:22,620
Come see me, Mother.

370
00:34:24,329 --> 00:34:25,527
What? Where?

371
00:34:26,082 --> 00:34:30,417
Come to my restaurant, Mother.

372
00:34:34,869 --> 00:34:36,569
I'll be waiting.

373
00:34:39,876 --> 00:34:41,497
Mu Jin.

374
00:34:42,978 --> 00:34:45,476
Was that Mu Jin? He wants to meet?

375
00:34:47,969 --> 00:34:49,513
- Hey.
- What?

376
00:34:49,538 --> 00:34:51,627
- What's gotten into him?
- Why?

377
00:34:52,519 --> 00:34:56,032
Why is he bringing me onto his own turf?

378
00:34:56,075 --> 00:34:58,989
Is he really going to bump me off?

379
00:35:00,464 --> 00:35:02,472
Bump you off?

380
00:35:03,310 --> 00:35:05,231
Between a mother and son?

381
00:35:05,256 --> 00:35:06,696
What movies have you been watching lately?

382
00:35:06,967 --> 00:35:09,574
What's wrong with you?
You weren't like this before.

383
00:35:10,109 --> 00:35:12,263
Is this because you've been seeing
that sparkling water guy?

384
00:35:13,875 --> 00:35:15,564
Yeah, I think that's it.

385
00:35:16,292 --> 00:35:17,357
Hurry up and go.

386
00:35:18,126 --> 00:35:19,254
Go on, hurry.

387
00:35:35,630 --> 00:35:38,583
- Enjoy your meal.
- Thank you. I will.

388
00:35:38,613 --> 00:35:40,445
- Have a good day.
- You too.

389
00:35:48,384 --> 00:35:51,184
Thanks to you, I'm almost done peeling.

390
00:35:51,654 --> 00:35:55,435
I don't know if I should be putting
such a precious chef to work like this.

391
00:35:57,576 --> 00:35:59,059
- Earlier...
- Yeah?

392
00:36:00,147 --> 00:36:04,235
You'd leave me in the crocodile swamp,

393
00:36:06,703 --> 00:36:08,995
drop Gyeol off somewhere safe,

394
00:36:09,992 --> 00:36:14,040
but then feel so bad about leaving me
that you'd come back for me.

395
00:36:14,234 --> 00:36:18,974
You'd walk right into the swamp
and die with me. That's what you'd do.

396
00:36:19,797 --> 00:36:20,900
Wouldn't you?

397
00:36:21,589 --> 00:36:23,923
You're still thinking about that?

398
00:36:25,906 --> 00:36:27,365
No, I'm not.

399
00:36:28,182 --> 00:36:29,626
Don't lie.

400
00:36:30,544 --> 00:36:31,904
You think I don't know you?

401
00:36:33,588 --> 00:36:35,903
Anyway, don't come back for me, okay?

402
00:36:36,075 --> 00:36:38,741
Don't make my sacrifice meaningless.
I'm serious.

403
00:36:41,795 --> 00:36:44,351
We're not Romeo and Juliet.

404
00:36:44,782 --> 00:36:47,998
Even if that crocodile eats me alive,

405
00:36:48,460 --> 00:36:50,595
with Gyeol taking good care of you,

406
00:36:50,620 --> 00:36:54,059
you should live a long, happy life
for as long as you live...

407
00:36:54,474 --> 00:36:56,789
Of course, you might not be happy
with me gone.

408
00:36:56,814 --> 00:36:59,143
Anyway, that's how you should live, okay?

409
00:37:00,708 --> 00:37:02,508
That's the only way I can die in peace.

410
00:37:02,888 --> 00:37:05,040
Why are you so serious?

411
00:37:05,149 --> 00:37:07,740
I was just giving an example.

412
00:37:10,111 --> 00:37:11,777
I'm saying you're too kind.

413
00:37:12,108 --> 00:37:14,038
You're such a kind, good person,

414
00:37:14,063 --> 00:37:17,582
like you don't have a selfish bone in you,

415
00:37:17,607 --> 00:37:21,523
and so incredible
that I just can't stop worrying.

416
00:37:21,627 --> 00:37:24,018
I really can't even sleep these days.

417
00:37:27,676 --> 00:37:29,303
Instead of dying together,

418
00:37:29,454 --> 00:37:33,845
I'll go fight off the crocodile
and save you.

419
00:37:34,369 --> 00:37:37,405
Gyeol, you, and me, the three of us,

420
00:37:37,430 --> 00:37:42,904
let's live happily ever after
until the end of the world.

421
00:37:43,431 --> 00:37:44,840
Good enough?

422
00:37:46,260 --> 00:37:49,480
Anyway, what I'm saying is,
don't just be nice all the time.

423
00:37:49,578 --> 00:37:52,257
Not everyone in the world
has a heart like yours, okay?

424
00:37:55,922 --> 00:38:00,688
Hey, don't just eat porridge.
Have some side dishes with it.

425
00:38:01,700 --> 00:38:03,886
- I'll bring you some water kimchi.
- I'm good.

426
00:38:08,738 --> 00:38:09,882
Gyu O.

427
00:38:11,959 --> 00:38:14,165
Isn't Gyeol's teacher coming to visit you?

428
00:38:17,815 --> 00:38:22,023
How will you ever find someone
as high-caliber as a teacher again?

429
00:38:22,560 --> 00:38:26,764
Whatever she says, just hold on to her
and don't let go.

430
00:38:30,829 --> 00:38:32,361
Beg her, even if you have to cry,

431
00:38:32,386 --> 00:38:37,041
and if she still wants to leave you,
tell her to just kill you.

432
00:38:37,328 --> 00:38:40,286
No, tell her you'll die together.

433
00:38:40,400 --> 00:38:41,930
Am I a gangster?

434
00:38:43,502 --> 00:38:44,774
So she's already gone.

435
00:38:46,083 --> 00:38:47,448
She left you.

436
00:38:51,110 --> 00:38:53,163
Right. That's why you got sick.

437
00:38:55,255 --> 00:38:57,505
Should I go beg her myself?

438
00:38:57,530 --> 00:38:59,437
Beg her to give you one more chance?

439
00:38:59,635 --> 00:39:02,297
Tell her that if she gives you a chance,
I won't give her any in-law grief,

440
00:39:02,322 --> 00:39:03,957
and I'll treat her like royalty?

441
00:39:03,982 --> 00:39:08,331
Should I go get down on my knees and beg?
For real?

442
00:39:12,827 --> 00:39:14,085
Such a shame.

443
00:39:18,916 --> 00:39:20,224
You know me, right?

444
00:39:21,612 --> 00:39:23,153
No, I don't.

445
00:39:23,899 --> 00:39:26,802
If it isn't Kwon Hui Na,
then it doesn't matter who it is.

446
00:39:27,724 --> 00:39:30,058
You're mine. I'll be the one to love you.

447
00:39:31,445 --> 00:39:32,892
I'll be the only one who loves you.

448
00:39:33,557 --> 00:39:35,368
You've heard of the woman who waited
so long she turned to stone, right?

449
00:39:35,609 --> 00:39:37,829
I almost turned to stone waiting for you.

450
00:39:38,200 --> 00:39:39,872
How are you going to make it up to me?

451
00:39:45,355 --> 00:39:47,113
I used to be a host bar escort.

452
00:39:47,706 --> 00:39:50,392
That's past tense. Not present tense.

453
00:39:50,558 --> 00:39:52,145
So what are you now?

454
00:39:52,221 --> 00:39:57,176
Did you love me, or do you love me?

455
00:39:57,437 --> 00:39:59,750
I love you. Present tense.

456
00:40:00,510 --> 00:40:03,675
Today, Kwon Hui Na
and I are getting married.

457
00:40:04,650 --> 00:40:08,029
Until the day I die, I'll protect
Hui Na and her family,

458
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:12,065
respect them, and love her
more than myself.

459
00:40:12,090 --> 00:40:14,040
(Hui Na)

460
00:40:16,404 --> 00:40:17,657
(Delete Contact)

461
00:40:17,682 --> 00:40:19,230
(No results found)

462
00:41:06,447 --> 00:41:07,512
Han Gyu O.

463
00:41:10,698 --> 00:41:13,097
Did you see a ghost?
Why are you so startled?

464
00:41:13,122 --> 00:41:15,162
I heard you couldn't come in today.

465
00:41:15,393 --> 00:41:16,849
I never said that.

466
00:41:17,796 --> 00:41:20,398
Gyu Min called this morning...

467
00:41:21,282 --> 00:41:22,496
Are you hiding something?

468
00:41:23,052 --> 00:41:25,151
Why are you acting so suspicious?
You're even stuttering.

469
00:41:26,889 --> 00:41:28,127
Just go home.

470
00:41:28,281 --> 00:41:31,207
Go home and rest today.
I heard you were sick all night.

471
00:41:32,761 --> 00:41:33,873
I'm all better.

472
00:41:42,988 --> 00:41:44,117
Seo Min Ju.

473
00:41:46,450 --> 00:41:48,704
She said she just stopped by to see me.

474
00:41:52,482 --> 00:41:55,633
You know I have a hard time
controlling myself.

475
00:41:56,235 --> 00:41:58,095
When I'm ticked off,
I don't care if it's a woman or a man.

476
00:41:58,775 --> 00:42:00,475
Get lost before I do anything worse.

477
00:42:04,322 --> 00:42:05,979
You're a gigolo, aren't you?

478
00:42:07,415 --> 00:42:11,590
You're a criminal who conned my mom
and took her money.

479
00:42:11,888 --> 00:42:15,828
Because of you, my mom can't sleep or eat,

480
00:42:16,017 --> 00:42:18,415
and she's so sick with stress and anger,
she's even seeing a psychiatrist.

481
00:42:19,354 --> 00:42:23,176
The guy who did that to my mom
doesn't get to be shameless and happy.

482
00:42:24,282 --> 00:42:26,191
If you do the crime, you do the time.

483
00:42:27,312 --> 00:42:29,894
You should suffer as much as my mom did.

484
00:42:30,393 --> 00:42:31,635
Don't you know me?

485
00:42:32,233 --> 00:42:36,946
Did you think I'd find out everything
and just keep my mouth shut?

486
00:42:37,640 --> 00:42:39,740
Did you think I'd let you be happy
all by yourself?

487
00:42:42,420 --> 00:42:46,444
Right. A guy like me
deserves to be punished.

488
00:42:46,730 --> 00:42:49,769
I should never be happy.
I should never live a good life.

489
00:42:50,310 --> 00:42:52,040
Everything you said is right,

490
00:42:54,369 --> 00:42:55,937
but why go after Hui Na?

491
00:42:57,775 --> 00:43:00,668
- What?
- Why go after poor Hui Na?

492
00:43:01,608 --> 00:43:03,221
What did she ever do?

493
00:43:03,727 --> 00:43:08,297
She's my victim too.
Why go after poor Hui Na?

494
00:43:13,953 --> 00:43:16,153
(Han Gyu O)

495
00:43:22,475 --> 00:43:24,960
Just give me the number
for Gyeol's teacher.

496
00:43:25,128 --> 00:43:26,743
I said I'll go and beg her.

497
00:43:26,887 --> 00:43:29,969
For now, don't get involved.
Just sit tight, Dad.

498
00:43:30,149 --> 00:43:32,268
And don't say a word to Gyu O
about Ms. Kwon.

499
00:43:32,455 --> 00:43:35,467
You kids used to throw a fit,
saying I didn't care about you.

500
00:43:35,492 --> 00:43:36,848
I put it on inside out.

501
00:43:37,688 --> 00:43:40,401
Hey, now you complain
when I pay attention, too?

502
00:43:40,635 --> 00:43:43,276
I want to be the dad I never got to be.

503
00:43:43,301 --> 00:43:47,433
Dad, I'm kind of busy right now.
I'll call you back later. Okay.

504
00:43:49,708 --> 00:43:52,068
- Was that Dad?
- What now?

505
00:43:52,715 --> 00:43:53,994
No, it's nothing.

506
00:43:54,428 --> 00:43:57,019
You two came straight here
without going home?

507
00:43:57,044 --> 00:43:58,176
Yeah.

508
00:44:00,774 --> 00:44:03,504
But didn't you say
you hired someone to help?

509
00:44:03,818 --> 00:44:05,351
Why are you working alone?

510
00:44:05,438 --> 00:44:07,889
She had something to do,
so she stepped out.

511
00:44:09,967 --> 00:44:11,972
This is a present for you.

512
00:44:12,028 --> 00:44:14,755
What's this?
Why a present all of a sudden?

513
00:44:15,068 --> 00:44:16,195
Take it, Gyu Rim.

514
00:44:16,220 --> 00:44:19,496
Gyu Seo modeled for these cosmetics.
Not a freebie. He bought them himself.

515
00:44:19,801 --> 00:44:23,376
You haven't been sleeping well lately,
and your skin looks so dull and dry.

516
00:44:24,919 --> 00:44:27,770
How could you afford to buy this?

517
00:44:27,922 --> 00:44:30,165
I have enough money to buy you cosmetics.

518
00:44:31,928 --> 00:44:35,105
I tried some on at the store earlier.

519
00:44:35,643 --> 00:44:36,788
Look.

520
00:44:44,697 --> 00:44:46,079
Super moisturizing, right?

521
00:44:50,249 --> 00:44:53,013
You look so much brighter now!

522
00:44:53,038 --> 00:44:55,413
It looks really good.

523
00:44:56,869 --> 00:44:58,225
Thank you, Gyu Seo.

524
00:44:58,922 --> 00:45:01,547
- We want you to live like a flower.
- We want you to live like a flower.

525
00:45:02,432 --> 00:45:05,077
- No way! You thought that too?
- No way! You thought that too?

526
00:45:06,596 --> 00:45:07,717
Me first.

527
00:45:09,482 --> 00:45:11,493
Don't worry about the family,

528
00:45:11,694 --> 00:45:14,668
use nice cosmetics, and live like a flower
as pretty as your face.

529
00:45:15,534 --> 00:45:17,972
No way.

530
00:45:18,007 --> 00:45:20,991
I was about to say the same thing
as you, word for word.

531
00:45:21,593 --> 00:45:24,423
Should we keep some distance for a while?

532
00:45:26,858 --> 00:45:27,880
Come here.

533
00:45:32,993 --> 00:45:36,628
What would I have done without you two?

534
00:45:38,316 --> 00:45:40,123
Thank you for being born.

535
00:45:40,694 --> 00:45:45,401
Gyu Seo, Gyu Min, thank you so much
for being my little brother and sister.

536
00:45:58,027 --> 00:45:59,588
This meat is a work of art.

537
00:45:59,613 --> 00:46:01,863
Here's the extra meat you ordered.

538
00:46:04,814 --> 00:46:08,121
Your boss just went to the bank.
Why isn't she back yet?

539
00:46:08,347 --> 00:46:10,576
Well, I'm not sure.
I just got here myself.

540
00:46:11,160 --> 00:46:12,582
But why are you looking for her?

541
00:46:12,667 --> 00:46:14,983
If you have something to say,
you can tell me.

542
00:46:16,374 --> 00:46:18,749
It's not something I'd tell
someone like you, miss.

543
00:46:18,852 --> 00:46:24,066
This is a hair-pulling fight
I need to have with the owner, so, miss...

544
00:46:27,094 --> 00:46:28,489
Pulling hair?

545
00:46:30,900 --> 00:46:33,076
Did my mom skip out on paying you
or something?

546
00:46:34,167 --> 00:46:35,372
What did my mom do?

547
00:46:37,007 --> 00:46:39,845
Yun Hui is your mom? How?

548
00:46:40,021 --> 00:46:43,267
What do you mean, how?
She's my mom, and I'm her daughter.

549
00:46:46,114 --> 00:46:47,544
Are you Gyu Yeong, by any chance?

550
00:46:47,708 --> 00:46:50,169
No, I'm not. I'm Jang Seo Hyeon.

551
00:46:50,421 --> 00:46:51,494
Seo Hyeon.

552
00:46:52,220 --> 00:46:54,715
Mom, do you know this lady?

553
00:46:55,653 --> 00:46:57,496
Why are you here instead of at work?

554
00:46:57,887 --> 00:46:59,401
It's my day off.

555
00:46:59,581 --> 00:47:02,317
I hear she's your daughter?

556
00:47:03,173 --> 00:47:05,820
She looks about Gyu Rim's age,
give or take a year or two.

557
00:47:06,546 --> 00:47:08,530
She's not your biological daughter,
is she?

558
00:47:08,800 --> 00:47:10,799
You didn't cheat on him too, did you?

559
00:47:10,920 --> 00:47:13,366
I've put up with a lot, but you...

560
00:47:14,874 --> 00:47:18,078
Your new husband's daughter?

561
00:47:21,714 --> 00:47:23,070
Why are you here?

562
00:47:23,234 --> 00:47:26,207
You ignored my calls,
so I came in person. Why?

563
00:47:26,607 --> 00:47:29,228
Mom, is this lady someone you know?

564
00:47:30,536 --> 00:47:32,020
I'll take your call.

565
00:47:32,215 --> 00:47:35,751
I'll pick up, so let's talk on the phone.
Could you leave now?

566
00:47:37,020 --> 00:47:39,909
I haven't finished my meat yet.
I still have drinks left.

567
00:47:40,434 --> 00:47:44,007
If I'm going to make a scene,
I'll make it at your place!

568
00:47:45,657 --> 00:47:46,697
Ji Hui.

569
00:47:49,559 --> 00:47:51,075
Why are you taking my drink?

570
00:47:51,867 --> 00:47:54,252
I'll give you a new bottle,
so take it home and drink it there.

571
00:47:54,926 --> 00:47:57,823
I'll pack up the leftover meat too,
so just take it.

572
00:47:57,887 --> 00:47:59,257
I'll pay the bill.

573
00:47:59,721 --> 00:48:02,497
If I were just going to leave,
why would I take the subway,

574
00:48:02,522 --> 00:48:05,779
transfer to a bus, and go through all that
to come all the way here?

575
00:48:07,101 --> 00:48:08,581
I have a business to run.

576
00:48:08,885 --> 00:48:11,421
So later...

577
00:48:11,446 --> 00:48:15,094
I came here to make one thing clear.

578
00:48:18,781 --> 00:48:21,835
Do you have feelings for Seok Jung?

579
00:48:23,861 --> 00:48:27,099
Do you want to go back to your ex-husband?

580
00:48:27,361 --> 00:48:28,392
What?

581
00:48:29,394 --> 00:48:32,271
But why do you keep bringing up
stuff that's over and done with?

582
00:48:32,538 --> 00:48:34,259
Whether I was good to your kids or not,

583
00:48:34,284 --> 00:48:36,631
why do you keep picking at that now?

584
00:48:37,374 --> 00:48:39,812
Why? Is your new husband giving you grief?

585
00:48:40,094 --> 00:48:42,816
Do you want to be Gyu Rim, Gyu Yeong,
and Gyu O's mom again?

586
00:48:42,841 --> 00:48:44,002
Hey, lady!

587
00:48:47,920 --> 00:48:50,999
I told you I want to live
with Seok Jung again.

588
00:48:51,024 --> 00:48:52,999
So, are you jealous or something?

589
00:48:53,182 --> 00:48:54,561
Unbelievable, this lady.

590
00:48:54,586 --> 00:48:56,372
You think you can say whatever you want?

591
00:48:56,540 --> 00:48:58,361
I said, do you think you can just say
whatever you want?

592
00:48:58,386 --> 00:48:59,408
Later.

593
00:49:00,024 --> 00:49:02,150
Come outside. Let's talk.

594
00:49:02,594 --> 00:49:05,667
No. So you can hit me out there?

595
00:49:06,100 --> 00:49:07,289
Hit her, Mom. Go on.

596
00:49:07,341 --> 00:49:10,060
If you want to hit her, hit her.
I'll keep watch. Hit her.

597
00:49:10,085 --> 00:49:14,397
What? How dare you talk
to an adult like that?

598
00:49:14,920 --> 00:49:16,829
Is that how your parents raised you?

599
00:49:16,854 --> 00:49:19,321
Let go. Let go of her.

600
00:49:19,346 --> 00:49:20,890
- How dare you lay a hand on her?
- She didn't.

601
00:49:20,915 --> 00:49:23,093
My mom taught me that even when
things are unfair and infuriating,

602
00:49:23,118 --> 00:49:25,111
I should let it go and be patient,

603
00:49:25,276 --> 00:49:28,103
but I just can't put up
with someone like you.

604
00:49:28,176 --> 00:49:31,342
I'm trying hard not to punch you
and give you a bloody nose.

605
00:49:31,367 --> 00:49:33,704
What? You little brat!

606
00:49:35,062 --> 00:49:36,377
Seo Hyeon!

607
00:49:38,227 --> 00:49:39,949
How dare you lay a hand on her?

608
00:49:41,220 --> 00:49:43,771
How dare you touch my precious child?

609
00:49:45,334 --> 00:49:48,403
Let go, Yun Hui. Everyone's watching.

610
00:49:49,187 --> 00:49:54,290
Since when does an owner grab a customer
and make a scene so nobody can eat?

611
00:49:56,765 --> 00:49:59,661
Let go of me, I said!

612
00:50:00,766 --> 00:50:02,940
You're so tiny. How are you so strong?

613
00:50:03,040 --> 00:50:05,197
Everyone's going to see!

614
00:50:06,558 --> 00:50:08,211
I'm sorry, everyone.

615
00:50:09,318 --> 00:50:12,244
I tried so hard to hold it in,

616
00:50:12,677 --> 00:50:14,508
but I just couldn't.

617
00:50:17,108 --> 00:50:19,198
This girl is my friend's little sister,

618
00:50:20,002 --> 00:50:22,162
and she seduced a married man
with three kids,

619
00:50:23,002 --> 00:50:26,415
kicked me out,
and moved in with my husband.

620
00:50:26,648 --> 00:50:28,581
Have you lost your mind, Yun Hui?

621
00:50:28,607 --> 00:50:31,872
I tried to give up on my husband,
telling myself he wasn't human,

622
00:50:32,387 --> 00:50:37,414
and I fought hard to keep going
for my little kids,

623
00:50:39,014 --> 00:50:41,862
but I just can't hold it in anymore.

624
00:50:43,959 --> 00:50:46,673
Let go. Are you letting go or not?

625
00:50:46,740 --> 00:50:49,087
Have you no shame? Are you crazy?

626
00:50:49,969 --> 00:50:51,274
How embarrassing.

627
00:50:51,355 --> 00:50:54,519
Don't you need to run your business?
Do you want to shut down your restaurant?

628
00:50:57,774 --> 00:51:00,010
It's all stretched out now.

629
00:51:14,053 --> 00:51:15,870
I'm sorry, everyone.

630
00:51:16,799 --> 00:51:19,098
I really am sorry.

631
00:51:20,840 --> 00:51:23,330
You couldn't even eat in peace.

632
00:51:25,301 --> 00:51:26,865
I'm so sorry.

633
00:51:32,747 --> 00:51:36,300
Go see a psychiatrist
first thing in the morning, ma'am.

634
00:51:40,867 --> 00:51:44,104
- Hey, old lady!
- You'll pay for this, you witch!

635
00:51:49,008 --> 00:51:52,570
It's okay, ma'am. You did the right thing.

636
00:51:55,477 --> 00:51:58,138
I'm so sorry.

637
00:51:58,170 --> 00:52:02,096
I'm really sorry.

638
00:52:02,121 --> 00:52:05,846
It's okay. Don't cry. It's okay.

639
00:52:14,102 --> 00:52:15,603
I'm sorry.

640
00:52:28,562 --> 00:52:33,288
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

641
00:52:33,754 --> 00:52:35,807
Should I call Mu Jin
and tell him we're here?

642
00:52:37,066 --> 00:52:40,602
No, wait. Let me take a deep breath.

643
00:52:41,054 --> 00:52:42,699
Don't be so nervous.

644
00:52:42,801 --> 00:52:45,090
Mu Jin's not going
to kill you or anything.

645
00:52:45,754 --> 00:52:48,165
Hey, he might. He's capable of it.

646
00:52:48,393 --> 00:52:50,499
He takes after me. Once he loses it,

647
00:52:51,236 --> 00:52:53,281
anything could happen.

648
00:52:53,542 --> 00:52:55,640
So stay right by my side today. Got it?

649
00:52:56,474 --> 00:52:58,433
Right next to me.

650
00:53:14,819 --> 00:53:16,587
Was the traffic bad?

651
00:53:17,921 --> 00:53:18,925
Where's Jeong Woo?

652
00:53:19,194 --> 00:53:22,572
He didn't come. It's our regular day off.

653
00:53:22,754 --> 00:53:24,602
I see.

654
00:53:26,440 --> 00:53:27,457
Mu Jin.

655
00:53:28,086 --> 00:53:31,065
I'll get her a taxi myself today.

656
00:53:31,214 --> 00:53:32,240
You can go home, Yun Jin.

657
00:53:32,400 --> 00:53:35,302
Why? Yun Jin should come inside too.

658
00:53:35,920 --> 00:53:37,720
I want to talk with her alone today.

659
00:53:38,367 --> 00:53:39,747
Just for today,
give us some room, Yun Jin.

660
00:53:44,481 --> 00:53:46,502
Okay. Got it.

661
00:54:30,134 --> 00:54:31,640
Please wait here for a moment.

662
00:54:45,406 --> 00:54:47,766
There's really no one here?

663
00:54:49,514 --> 00:54:53,467
That guy didn't go get a knife, did he?

664
00:55:09,573 --> 00:55:12,368
It's the sea bass steak you like, Mother.

665
00:55:28,307 --> 00:55:31,415
Did you poison it? My plate?

666
00:55:50,706 --> 00:55:54,376
Go ahead. This is your first time
trying my cooking, isn't it?

667
00:56:10,060 --> 00:56:11,105
That's right.

668
00:56:13,500 --> 00:56:14,961
What do you want to do with me?

669
00:56:15,894 --> 00:56:17,366
Do you want to strangle me?

670
00:56:17,901 --> 00:56:20,283
You know, killing your own parent
carries a heavier sentence, right?

671
00:56:30,573 --> 00:56:32,080
Did you poison the wine?

672
00:56:41,069 --> 00:56:42,076
Fine.

673
00:56:43,702 --> 00:56:45,800
I lost my head for a moment.

674
00:56:46,501 --> 00:56:48,837
I went too far.
I was petty. I was childish.

675
00:56:50,423 --> 00:56:51,510
But...

676
00:56:53,169 --> 00:56:58,928
do you think I did it only for myself,
just for me?

677
00:57:00,725 --> 00:57:03,826
That I did it for my own wealth and glory?

678
00:57:19,967 --> 00:57:24,502
I did it for you. You!

679
00:57:25,467 --> 00:57:30,103
So you could enjoy all the wealth, glory,
and honor in the world.

680
00:57:30,680 --> 00:57:34,736
So you could rise higher than your father,
higher than me,

681
00:57:34,761 --> 00:57:39,136
and be cooler and more amazing
so no one could catch up...

682
00:57:40,133 --> 00:57:41,990
I'm afraid of heights, Mother.

683
00:57:43,327 --> 00:57:45,320
That's not what I meant, and you know it.

684
00:57:45,628 --> 00:57:47,145
Still...

685
00:57:48,327 --> 00:57:50,072
I wanted to overcome it,

686
00:57:51,012 --> 00:57:54,476
so a while ago, I went up
to the roof of a 100-story building.

687
00:57:55,109 --> 00:57:56,129
But...

688
00:57:59,367 --> 00:58:03,557
I couldn't breathe and almost died.

689
00:58:05,087 --> 00:58:06,632
Are you illiterate or something?

690
00:58:08,114 --> 00:58:09,772
You don't understand what I'm saying?

691
00:58:09,797 --> 00:58:15,511
Cold sweats, a panic attack...
I really came close to death.

692
00:58:16,500 --> 00:58:20,505
If there hadn't been people around,
I might have actually died.

693
00:58:26,321 --> 00:58:27,656
Please spare me, Mother.

694
00:58:29,495 --> 00:58:32,042
Mu Jin!

695
00:58:32,281 --> 00:58:33,399
I never want to go up...

696
00:58:35,487 --> 00:58:37,793
that 100-story building again.

697
00:58:38,161 --> 00:58:40,214
There's no view up there
I'm dying to see anyway.

698
00:58:41,154 --> 00:58:45,079
I don't want to throw my life away
on some childish whim.

699
00:58:48,046 --> 00:58:49,826
Please spare me, okay?

700
00:58:51,129 --> 00:58:52,549
Please spare me, Mother.

701
00:58:53,888 --> 00:58:57,088
It's still a precious life
my parents gave me,

702
00:58:58,704 --> 00:59:02,580
so I want to take good care of it
and live safely and happily,

703
00:59:03,562 --> 00:59:07,384
for a really long time,
until the end of the world.

704
00:59:09,040 --> 00:59:11,130
Thank you for giving birth to me
and raising me.

705
00:59:11,860 --> 00:59:15,976
I'll spend the rest of my life
paying you back.

706
00:59:16,157 --> 00:59:17,203
So,

707
00:59:23,220 --> 00:59:24,236
just once,

708
00:59:27,000 --> 00:59:28,348
just this once,

709
00:59:30,900 --> 00:59:32,498
please spare me just this once, Mother.

710
00:59:36,546 --> 00:59:37,849
Please.

711
01:00:05,959 --> 01:00:07,129
We're closed.

712
01:00:18,200 --> 01:00:20,615
We're closed, so please leave.

713
01:00:21,226 --> 01:00:22,571
You know Han Gyu Yeong, right?

714
01:00:27,787 --> 01:00:30,923
How do you know Gyu Yeong?

715
01:00:31,680 --> 01:00:34,035
There's something I need
to tell you about her,

716
01:00:34,368 --> 01:00:37,821
so could you give me a minute?

717
01:00:48,220 --> 01:00:54,117
<i>At the market there are cabbages
sweet potatoes and onions</i>

718
01:00:54,142 --> 01:00:58,348
<i>At the market there are cabbages
sweet potatoes and</i>

719
01:00:59,061 --> 01:01:01,975
What came next again?

720
01:01:02,366 --> 01:01:06,459
<i>I'm not telling you
Would it be a game if I told you</i>

721
01:01:06,546 --> 01:01:10,500
<i>You bastard If you were
on one of those deadly game shows</i>

722
01:01:10,720 --> 01:01:13,341
<i>you'd betray your own
mother and sell her out</i>

723
01:01:13,401 --> 01:01:16,196
<i>You think I'm that guy from the show</i>

724
01:01:16,253 --> 01:01:19,127
<i>Even if it kills me
I'll never leave you on your own Mom</i>

725
01:01:19,294 --> 01:01:22,082
<i>Yeah right</i>

726
01:01:22,107 --> 01:01:24,509
<i>You won't even tell me
what comes after sweet potatoes</i>

727
01:01:24,534 --> 01:01:27,420
<i>something that small</i>

728
01:01:27,987 --> 01:01:29,125
Onions.

729
01:01:30,188 --> 01:01:32,904
<i>There are onions and sweet pancakes</i>

730
01:01:34,494 --> 01:01:37,416
<i>At the market there are cabbages
sweet potatoes onions</i>

731
01:01:37,441 --> 01:01:39,361
<i>sweet pancakes and chicken feet</i>

732
01:01:40,841 --> 01:01:44,296
<i>Look how fast you memorized it all</i>

733
01:01:44,321 --> 01:01:47,591
Looks like you are getting better.

734
01:01:48,441 --> 01:01:54,995
<i>At the market there are cabbages
sweet potatoes onions Hold on</i>

735
01:01:55,020 --> 01:01:56,631
What's that?

736
01:01:57,333 --> 01:01:59,207
(Song I Guk)

737
01:01:59,238 --> 01:02:01,960
I Guk? It's I Guk.
What's going on with him?

738
01:02:01,985 --> 01:02:06,596
Something must've happened at the store.
What are you doing? Answer it.

739
01:02:06,960 --> 01:02:13,567
Hey, I Guk. What? Who? Gyu Yeong? What?

740
01:02:14,167 --> 01:02:18,273
Gyu Yeong will know if I tell her "PS?"
What's "PS?"

741
01:02:20,254 --> 01:02:22,281
A psycho came to Han Gyu Rim's shop?

742
01:02:24,280 --> 01:02:28,761
Wait, Han Gyu Rim left with that psycho?
Where to?

743
01:02:28,980 --> 01:02:30,702
Didn't they say where they were going?

744
01:02:41,121 --> 01:02:42,561
How do you know Gyu Yeong?

745
01:02:43,608 --> 01:02:46,094
How does someone like you know Gyu Yeong?

746
01:02:49,114 --> 01:02:50,231
Someone like me?

747
01:03:03,274 --> 01:03:05,007
What kind of person am I?

748
01:03:06,999 --> 01:03:09,829
Forget it. I shouldn't have followed you.

749
01:03:10,400 --> 01:03:12,799
There's no way Gyu Yeong
would know someone like you.

750
01:03:20,866 --> 01:03:22,500
I'm Gyu Yeong's husband.

751
01:03:24,441 --> 01:03:29,829
Your sister drugged my parents and me
and ran away from home.

752
01:03:31,675 --> 01:03:34,044
How did you raise that girl?

753
01:03:45,267 --> 01:03:47,367
Finally, she's calling me.

754
01:03:48,234 --> 01:03:50,421
(Gyu Yeong)

755
01:03:56,427 --> 01:03:57,713
Honey.

756
01:03:59,739 --> 01:04:01,128
Han Gyu Yeong!

757
01:04:03,394 --> 01:04:05,300
Hey, you crazy psycho.

758
01:04:05,387 --> 01:04:08,793
I'll come right over.
Give me your address. Now.

759
01:04:11,859 --> 01:04:14,367
Fine, I'll come alone,

760
01:04:14,721 --> 01:04:18,817
without Cho Heung Sik,
so tell me where you are, you jerk!

761
01:04:20,813 --> 01:04:22,551
Just try bringing Cho Heung Sik along.

762
01:04:23,073 --> 01:04:28,892
Try anything again,
and you'll be at your sister's funeral.

763
01:04:31,500 --> 01:04:32,821
Gyu Yeong, what's going on?

764
01:04:33,261 --> 01:04:35,449
Is something going on with you?

765
01:04:35,474 --> 01:04:36,506
Give it to me!

766
01:04:36,834 --> 01:04:39,053
How dare you!

767
01:04:39,983 --> 01:04:43,698
Why would you follow that jerk?
Do you want to die?

768
01:04:44,781 --> 01:04:47,107
Run right now. Got it?

769
01:04:47,879 --> 01:04:52,185
He's a total psycho,
so run right now, Han Gyu Rim!

770
01:05:27,804 --> 01:05:29,824
(Love on the Menu)

771
01:05:29,849 --> 01:05:33,359
Who are you to butt into my business?

772
01:05:33,384 --> 01:05:36,936
Want to watch a life hit rock bottom
in real time? Just look in a mirror.

773
01:05:37,034 --> 01:05:38,961
Mom, what happened to your face?

774
01:05:38,986 --> 01:05:42,356
I'm sorry, Gyu Rim. I was wrong.

775
01:05:42,446 --> 01:05:43,586
I'm sorry.

776
01:05:43,611 --> 01:05:46,749
Did you say no because I'm a burden?

777
01:05:47,007 --> 01:05:48,276
Why would you be a burden?

778
01:05:48,301 --> 01:05:51,225
You know Han Gyeol, right?
Han Gyu Rim's son.

779
01:05:51,360 --> 01:05:54,738
I think I'm Gyeol's biological father.

780
01:05:54,763 --> 01:05:55,819
What?

781
01:05:56,871 --> 01:05:58,671
Dramaday.me
